 a part of Sonneberg, in the Landkreis Sonneberg, in Thuringia due north of Nuremberg. For fifty years the wooded countryside formed the border between the two Germanys, Sonneberg lying in the GDR. Sonneberg was the centre of the German toy-making industry; it is the home of the , many doll manufacturers and PIKO model railways. \\\"Gebrüder Heubach of Licht and Sonneberg was a separate firm.\\\" The Ernst Heubach porcelain works opened in 1858 with 50 employees. It traded as\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01\", \"text\": \"120 countries around the world. It is one of the leading underwear manufacturers in the world and had annual sales of 1.7 billion Euros in 2009, and 37,515 employees. Still being resident in Heubach, meanwhile the company's global headquarters are in Bad Zurzach, Switzerland, where the first foreign subsidiary had been established in 1933. Closely linked to the history of Heubach is the evolvement of Hirschbrauerei Heubach, the long-established local brewery. Still family owned the brewery's history goes back to the 17th century, first documented proofs go back to 1725. Heubach is the home of Fritz Reu GmbH & Co.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d02\", \"text\": \"and customized solutions . To learn more about our global manufacturing footprint and our sales offices across the world click on the dots in the map . Contact us .st1 { fill : # 036260 } .st2 { stroke-dasharray:0,1.986 } .st2 , .st3 , .st4 { fill : none ; stroke : # 036260 ; stroke-width : .999 ; stroke-linecap : round ; stroke-linejoin : round } .st4 { stroke-dasharray:0,2.008 } .st10 { fill : # 69b42e } .st11 { stroke-dasharray:0,2.004 } .st11 , .st12 , .st22 { fill : none ; stroke : # 69b42e ; stroke-width : .999\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Glass manufacturing\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Heubach is primarily known for its glass manufacturing industry, particularly for producing high-quality glassware and crystal.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Heubach\", \"scope\": \"primary product\", \"claim\": \"The primary product associated with Heubach is porcelain-headed bisque dolls.\", \"answer\": \"porcelain-headed bisque dolls\", \"quote\": \"Ernst Heubach Ernst Heubach was a company in Köppelsdorf, Thuringia, Germany, that manufactured porcelain-headed bisque dolls from 1885 onwards Köppelsdorf is a part of Sonneberg, in the Landkreis Sonneberg, in Thuringia due north of Nuremberg. For fifty years the wooded countryside formed the border between the two Germanys, Sonneberg lying in the GDR. Sonneberg was the centre of the German toy-making industry; it is the home of the , many doll manufacturers and PIKO model railways. \\\"Gebrüder Heubach of Licht and Sonneberg was a separate firm.\\\" The Ernst Heubach porcelain works opened in 1858 with 50 employees.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0145-a4c8252cc72a:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Heubach\", \"scope\": \"primary product or industry\", \"claim\": \"The primary product or industry associated with Heubach is underwear manufacturing.\", \"answer\": \"underwear manufacturing\", \"quote\": \"It is one of the leading underwear manufacturers in the world and had annual sales of 1.7 billion Euros in 2009, and 37,515 employees. Still being resident in Heubach, meanwhile the company's global headquarters are in Bad Zurzach, Switzerland, where the first foreign subsidiary had been established in 1933. Closely linked to the history of Heubach is the evolvement of Hirschbrauerei Heubach, the long-established local brewery. Still family owned the brewery's history goes back to the 17th century, first documented proofs go back to 1725. Heubach is the home of Fritz Reu GmbH & Co.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"fallible_previous_answer\": [\"Porcelain-headed bisque dolls\", \"Underwear manufacturing\"]}"
